    "body": "@annevk Thanks for the links, great info!\r\n\r\n@Yay295 Thanks a lot for the example source code! Using your source code In Chrome and Safari I get exactly one FontFace back for Arial (as expected as we request the FontFace for the given name). However I need to have a list (or font dialog) of all font names on the system so that I can give the user the choice to use them in the 2D canvas.",
