    "updated_at": "2018-01-22T20:42:58Z",
    "body": "Ah right, a dialog whose content are opaque to user code.  Interesting...\r\n@fserb: On mobile the browser would have to implement it's own dialog, from the Web Platform's perspective, it makes no difference whether the dialog comes from the browser or the OS (AFAIK).\r\n",
